[00:00.88] If only tonight we could sleep
[00:05.38] In a bed made of flowers
[00:10.80] If only tonight we could fall
[00:13.42] In a deathless spell
[02:45.44] If only tonight we could slide
[02:49.52] Into deep black water
[02:56.82] And breathe
[02:58.90] And breathe
[02:58.90] Then an angel would come
[03:02.24] With burning eyes like stars
[03:04.02] And bury us deep
[03:16.18] In his velvet arms
[03:19.04] And the rain would cry
[04:00.58] As our faces slipped away
[04:06.18] And the rain would cry
[04:12.36] Don't let it end
